      <title>收集的Android Apps</title>
      <link>http://blog.imcompany.cn/posts/android-apps/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 24 Jul 2025 08:12:23 +0800</pubDate>
      <guid>http://blog.imcompany.cn/posts/android-apps/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;orgzly-orgzly-android-outliner-for-taking-notes-and-managing-to-do-lists&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/orgzly/orgzly-android?__readwiseLocation=&#34;&gt;orgzly/orgzly-android: Outliner for taking notes and managing to-do lists&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Android上日记与TODO应用，基于Org mode&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;xlucn-oh-my-foss-android-个人收集的实用-良心开源安卓软件&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/xlucn/oh-my-foss-android&#34;&gt;xlucn/oh-my-foss-android: 个人收集的实用、良心开源安卓软件&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Android软件集&lt;/p&gt;
