&lt;p&gt;Blocker 是一款操作Android应用程序四大组件的程序, 禁用无用功能(禁用一些广告 SDK 组件)，节约应用运行资源的功能&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;gkd-kit-gkd-基于无障碍-高级选择器-订阅规则的自定义屏幕点击-android-应用-an-android-app-with-custom-screen-tapping-based-on-accessibility-advanced-selectors-and-subscription-rules&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/gkd-kit/gkd&#34;&gt;gkd-kit/gkd: 基于无障碍，高级选择器，订阅规则的自定义屏幕点击 Android 应用 | An Android APP with custom screen tapping based on Accessibility, Advanced Selectors, and Subscription Rules&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;跳过开屏广告&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;adaway-adaway-adaway-is-a-free-and-open-source-ad-blocker-for-android-dot&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/AdAway/AdAway&#34;&gt;AdAway/AdAway: AdAway is a free and open source ad blocker for Android.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;广告拦截APP，通过 hosts 或者 vpn 模式阻止广告请求&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;yuliskov-smarttube-browse-media-content-with-your-own-rules-on-android-tv&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/yuliskov/SmartTube&#34;&gt;yuliskov/SmartTube: Browse media content with your own rules on Android TV&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Android上无广告看Youtube&lt;/p&gt;</description>
